    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your exocortex is synchronized with your brain to remotely control your drone companion through a direct mental link. At 1st level, choose three different level-1 Commercial Customizations for the drone.</p><p>The link has a range of 150 feet. Beyond that range, the drone cannot take actions. During daily preparations, the drone is restored to maximum Hit Points. Repairing it out of combat takes 1 hour, reduced to 10 minutes with Quick Repair. The exocortex program is immune to glitching; this does not protect the drone's physical body from environmental glitching.</p><p>The range, restoration, repair-time reduction, and program-only glitch immunity are recorded here as rules text; they require linked-actor or daily-preparation automation that item rule elements do not provide.</p>"
    },
